es-rgds-apirefresh: changes made through the HTTP API refresh the game lists once, when they stop

A media tool pushing art for every game (ROCKNIXDS's background scrape) made ES repopulate every list showing the
game after each picture: themes drawn by ES itself (dii-ess-aye, Canvas-DS) blanked and reloaded their lists over
and over and dropped input while they did (ROCKNIXDS issue 25). API changes are now collected, and the lists they
touch repopulate once, 1.5 s after the last change and the last button press. Changes made in ES's own menus are
unchanged (at once).

